        {
          "text": "Kingata rotyengwa Maanaim akurel koro Pasyan kïmïkul nyo kipöytoy Ok pöytoghinto Pasyan nko kanastin löwïr cho pö Yair cho mi Pasyan, kanastin 60 ",
